<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to Weak, instances $0.50 Lower. Demand and movement were moderate. Top $50.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  48.50-50.00 few 48.00 &amp; 50.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  43.00-48.00</p>
<p>	  210-230 lbs.  38.50-43.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/weak. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-43.00</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 45.00-48.00 few over 600 lbs. 49.00</p>
</text>
